  "grammar": [
    {
      "id": "b3_u05_l1_g1",
      "pattern": "A-게",
      "meaning_uz": "...cha, ...ib (sifatdan ravish yasash)",
      "meaning_en": "-ly (adjective → adverb)",
      "explanation_md": "**-게** sifatni **ravishga** aylantiradi: ish-harakat **qanday** bajarilishini ko'rsatadi.\n\n**건강하게 지내세요.** — *Sog'lom yuring.*  \n**싱겁게 먹는 게 좋아요.** — *Tuzsizroq yegan yaxshi.*\n\n### Qanday yasaladi\n\n**-다** o'rniga **-게** — 받침 ga qarab o'zgarmaydi:\n\n- 건강하다 → **건강하게**, 깨끗하다 → **깨끗하게**\n- 맛있다 → **맛있게**, 즐겁다 → **즐겁게**\n- 짜다 → **짜게**, 싱겁다 → **싱겁게**\n\n### Esda tuting\n\n- Tayyor iboralar: **맛있게 드세요** (yoqimli ishtaha), **재미있게 보내세요** (qiziqarli o'tkazing), **편하게 앉으세요** (bemalol o'tiring).\n- 1-kitobdagi **많이, 빨리** — maxsus ravishlar; ko'p boshqa sifatlar -게 bilan yasaladi.\n- **ㅂ** sifatlarda ham o'zgarish yo'q: 즐겁다 → **즐겁게** (~~즐거워게~~ emas).",
      "explanation_md_en": "**-게** turns an adjective into an **adverb**: it tells you **how** something is done.\n\n**건강하게 지내세요.** — *Stay healthy.*  \n**싱겁게 먹는 게 좋아요.** — *It's better to eat less salty food.*\n\n### How to form it\n\nReplace **-다** with **-게** — no change for 받침:\n\n- 건강하다 → **건강하게**, 깨끗하다 → **깨끗하게**\n- 맛있다 → **맛있게**, 즐겁다 → **즐겁게**\n- 짜다 → **짜게**, 싱겁다 → **싱겁게**\n\n### Remember\n\n- Set phrases: **맛있게 드세요** (enjoy your meal), **재미있게 보내세요** (have fun), **편하게 앉으세요** (make yourself comfortable).\n- **많이, 빨리** from book 1 are special adverbs; most other adjectives use -게.\n- **ㅂ** adjectives don't change: 즐겁다 → **즐겁게** (not ~~즐거워게~~).",
      "formation": [
        {
          "condition_uz": "Har qanday sifat",
          "condition_en": "Any adjective",
          "rule": "A-다 → A-게",
          "example": "건강하게, 깨끗하게, 짜게"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "ㅂ sifat",
          "condition_en": "ㅂ adjective",
          "rule": "o'zgarishsiz + 게",
          "example": "즐겁게, 싱겁게"
        }
      ],
      "examples": [
