        }
      ],
      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchada sifatdan ravish ko'pincha '-cha' yoki shunchaki sifat bilan: 'sog'lom yuring', 'toza yuving'. Koreyschada doim -게 kerak: 건강하게, 깨끗하게.",
      "compare_en": "Like English '-ly': 'healthily', 'cleanly'. Korean adds -게 to almost any adjective: 건강하게, 깨끗하게."
    },
    {
      "id": "b3_u05_l1_g2",
