      "meaning_uz": "...ekan-ku! (yangi narsani payqab hayratlanish)",
      "meaning_en": "Oh, …! (noticing something)",
      "explanation_md": "**-네요** — gapiruvchi **hozirgina payqagan** narsasiga munosabat bildiradi: hayrat, maqtov, his. \"... ekan-ku!\", \"... ekansiz!\"\n\n**건강에 관심이 많네요.** — *Sog'likka juda qiziqar ekansiz.*  \n**살이 많이 빠졌네요!** — *Ancha ozibsiz-ku!*\n\n### Qanday yasaladi\n\n**-다** o'rniga **-네요** — 받침 ga qarab o'zgarmaydi:\n\n- 많다 → **많네요**, 좋다 → **좋네요**\n- 덥다 → **덥네요**, 맛있다 → **맛있네요**\n- O'tgan: 빠졌다 → **빠졌네요**\n- Ot: **N이네요 / N네요**: 학생**이네요**, 친구**네요**\n- **ㄹ** tushadi: 멀다 → **머네요**, 만들다 → **만드네요**\n\n### Esda tuting\n\n- O'zingiz **endi ko'rgan/bilgan** narsa uchun. Oldindan biladigan faktga emas: ~~제 이름은 아지즈네요~~.\n- Ko'pincha maqtovda: **한국어를 잘하네요!** — *Koreyschangiz zo'r ekan!*",
      "explanation_md_en": "**-네요** reacts to something the speaker **has just noticed**: surprise, praise or feeling. \"Oh, …!\", \"Wow, …!\"\n\n**건강에 관심이 많네요.** — *You're really into your health, aren't you!*  \n**살이 많이 빠졌네요!** — *You've lost a lot of weight!*\n\n### How to form it\n\nReplace **-다** with **-네요** — no change for 받침:\n\n- 많다 → **많네요**, 좋다 → **좋네요**\n- 덥다 → **덥네요**, 맛있다 → **맛있네요**\n- Past: 빠졌다 → **빠졌네요**\n- Noun: **N이네요 / N네요**: 학생**이네요**, 친구**네요**\n- **ㄹ** drops: 멀다 → **머네요**, 만들다 → **만드네요**\n\n### Remember\n\n- Only for what you've **just seen or learned**. Not for facts you already knew: not ~~제 이름은 아지즈네요~~.\n- Common in compliments: **한국어를 잘하네요!** — *Your Korean is great!*",
      "formation": [
        {
          "condition_uz": "Fe'l/sifat",
          "condition_en": "Verb/adjective",
          "rule": "-다 → -네요",
          "example": "많네요, 좋네요, 잘하네요"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "O'tgan",
          "condition_en": "Past",
          "rule": "-았/었네요",
          "example": "빠졌네요, 바뀌었네요"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "Ot",
          "condition_en": "Noun",
          "rule": "N(이)네요",
          "example": "학생이네요, 친구네요"
        }
      ],
