      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchadagi '... ekan-ku!' yoki '... ekansiz!' bilan bir xil: 'Ozibsiz-KU!' = 빠졌네요!, 'Zo'r EKAN!' = 잘하네요!",
      "compare_en": "Like English 'Oh, you've …!' or 'Wow, it's …!' when you notice something: 'You've lost weight!' = 살이 빠졌네요!"
