  "dialogue": {
    "lines": [
      {
        "speaker": "minji",
        "ko": "아지즈 씨, 살이 많이 빠졌네요!",
        "uz": "Aziz, ancha ozibsiz-ku!",
        "en": "Aziz, you've lost a lot of weight!",
        "audio": "5acbe4905bd7.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "네, 요즘 건강하게 먹으려고 해요.",
        "uz": "Ha, shu kunlarda sog'lom ovqatlanishga harakat qilyapman.",
        "en": "Yes, I'm trying to eat healthily these days.",
        "audio": "15e01c441f07.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "minji",
        "ko": "식습관을 바꿨어요?",
        "uz": "Ovqatlanish odatingizni o'zgartirdingizmi?",
        "en": "Did you change your eating habits?",
        "audio": "c8aaa13cee84.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "패스트푸드를 줄이고 채소를 많이 먹어요. 그리고 싱겁게 먹어요.",
        "uz": "Fast-fudni kamaytirib, sabzavotni ko'p yeyapman. Tuzsizroq ham.",
        "en": "I've cut down on fast food and eat lots of vegetables. And less salt.",
        "audio": "f476a2fb7376.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "minji",
        "ko": "와, 건강에 관심이 많네요. 운동도 해요?",
        "uz": "Voy, sog'likka juda qiziqar ekansiz. Sport ham qilasizmi?",
        "en": "Wow, you're really into your health. Do you exercise too?",
        "audio": "b6b5532821ea.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "네, 아침마다 자전거를 타요. 꾸준히 하니까 몸이 가벼워요.",
        "uz": "Ha, har ertalab velosiped haydayman. Doimiy qilganim uchun tanam yengil.",
        "en": "Yes, I cycle every morning. Doing it regularly makes my body feel light.",
        "audio": "0c3871b2ae0c.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "minji",
        "ko": "얼굴도 좋아 보이네요. 저는 요즘 스트레스를 많이 받아요.",
        "uz": "Yuzingiz ham yaxshi ko'rinyapti. Men shu kunlarda ko'p stress olyapman.",
        "en": "You look well too. I've been really stressed lately.",
        "audio": "6549937d7ba0.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "그럼 요가를 해 보는 게 어때요? 마음이 편해져요.",
        "uz": "Unda yoga qilib ko'rsangiz-chi? Ko'ngil tinchlanadi.",
        "en": "Then how about trying yoga? It calms you down.",
        "audio": "59601c7d22b0.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "minji",
        "ko": "좋아요. 잠도 충분히 자야겠네요.",
        "uz": "Yaxshi. Uyquni ham yetarli qilishim kerak ekan.",
        "en": "Good idea. I guess I need to get enough sleep too.",
        "audio": "8b4e95dae484.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "aziz",
        "ko": "네, 잠이 제일 중요해요.",
        "uz": "Ha, uyqu eng muhim.",
        "en": "Yes, sleep is the most important thing.",
        "audio": "022443bf3f30.mp3"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "minji",
        "ko": "아지즈 씨 덕분에 저도 건강하게 지낼 거예요!",
        "uz": "Aziz, sizning sharofatingiz bilan men ham sog'lom yashayman!",
        "en": "Thanks to you, Aziz, I'm going to live healthily too!",
        "audio": "954f19c168b9.mp3"
      }
    ]
  },
